@.str.77 = private unnamed_addr constant [728 x i8] c"Sweeps the line set rotationally about an axis.\0A\0AArgs:\0A    angle (float): The rotation angle in degree.\0A    axis (open3d.core.Tensor): The rotation axis.\0A    resolution (int): The resolution defines the number of intermediate sweeps\0A        about the rotation axis.\0A    translation (float): The translation along the rotation axis.\0A\0AReturns:\0A    A triangle mesh with the result of the sweep operation.\0A\0A\0AExample:\0A    This code generates a spring from a single line::\0A\0A        import open3d as o3d\0A\0A        line = o3d.t.geometry.LineSet([[0.7,0,0],[1,0,0]], [[0,1]])\0A        spring = line.extrude_rotation(3*360, [0,1,0], resolution=3*16, translation=2)\0A        o3d.visualization.draw([{'name': 'spring', 'geometry': spring}])\0A\0A\00", align 1
